# Excluded from the archive uploaded to EAS Build.
# The native folders are regenerated remotely by prebuild (CNG), dist/ is the
# web export, and .expo/ holds local caches and multi-MB xcodebuild logs.
# Anchored with a leading "/": only the project's own generated ios/ and
# android/, never a local module's (modules/*/ios, modules/*/android), whose
# native code the build needs.
dist/
.expo/
/ios/
/android/
